    "claim": "你內斂、不張揚，才華多收在裡面；收得有度最好，太收或太放都不相宜。",
    "en": "You are reserved and understated, keeping your gifts inside; you are at your best when you hold back just enough, neither too much nor too little.",
    "limit": "原文說最好是收斂略重、又有適度發揮。",
